Subject: Dump Data Format
Message-ID: <gtK7ULwodc4.wZPLAJG-mcIJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/gtK7ULwodc4/m/wZPLAJG-mcIJ>
