Subject: Meaning of lp__ and model complexity
Message-ID: <nmh5oy-Ox9U.-U-ZACF8qusJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/nmh5oy-Ox9U/m/-U-ZACF8qusJ>
