We're also working on Riemann-Manifold HMC, which does
the transformation of the geometry dynamically.
Check out Michael Betancourt's paper and refs therein:

   http://arxiv.org/pdf/1212.4693.pdf

The differential geometry perspective on HMC is very
enlightening.

- Bob

