You can read their experiments, but the upshot is
going to be that if the dimensionality is modest
(less than a couple thousand parameters) and the geometry
is complex (such as in the funnel), it will help
immensely.

Elsewhere, it's going to come down to our implementation
speeds and even we don't know where that's going to fall.

