Subject: Re: [stan-users] I am not sure what is going on
Message-ID: <-Wx_HVe5R-M.gHZhl1PROMEJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <-Wx_HVe5R-M.8DS3vlgDPw8J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <-Wx_HVe5R-M.11dc_Xbb78QJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <-Wx_HVe5R-M.8DS3vlgDPw8J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
